# Secrets must never reach a build context: a remote build uploads it to Fly's builder and its
# cache. Environment and private-key files are excluded at any depth, examples included, since no
# build reads them.
.env*
**/.env*
**/*.env
*.pem
**/*.pem
*.key
**/*.key
.checkout-surge
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
working_docs
scripts/composition-characterization.mjs
